# This folder's GitHub repo is PUBLIC (GitHub Pages). Ignore EVERYTHING by
# default and allow only the dashboard files, so code, spreadsheets, logs or
# anything personal can never be pushed by accident (even with "git add .").
*
!.gitignore
!.nojekyll
!index.html
!manifest.json
!public_data.json
!tracker.html
!lookahead.html
!pick_tracker_data.json
!dip_watch_data.json
!vol_regime.json
!history/
!history/*.json
